stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> ENDED
  ENDED --> ACTIVE: 開始 session（同 rules）
  ACTIVE --> IDLE: P_g ≥ p_maybe 且靜默 ≥ 3 s
  IDLE --> ACTIVE: P_g ≥ p_maybe 且靜默 ＜ 3 s
  ACTIVE --> MAYBE_AWAY: P_g ＜ p_maybe（0.6）
  IDLE --> MAYBE_AWAY: P_g ＜ p_maybe
  MAYBE_AWAY --> ACTIVE: P_g ≥ p_active（0.8）且靜默 ＜ 3 s（遲滯）
  MAYBE_AWAY --> IDLE: P_g ≥ p_active 且靜默 ≥ 3 s
  ACTIVE --> AWAY: P_g ＜ p_away（0.3）持續 away_hold_seconds（1 s）<br/>或 vision 且 present_max_silence ＞ 0 且靜默達上限
  IDLE --> AWAY: 同上
  MAYBE_AWAY --> AWAY: 同上
  AWAY --> ACTIVE: P_ret ≥ p_active<br/>vision：P_ret = P_影像（聲音不能讓人回來）<br/>balanced／audio：P_ret = P_g
  AWAY --> ENDED: 在 AWAY ≥ end_after_away（5 s）
  ACTIVE --> ACTIVE: NEW_GROUP（舊參與者 P 全 ＜ p_away + 新人 P ≥ p_active，持續 3 s）
